{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50170","headline":"咏萤（斯五五五） · 苏晋","name":"咏萤（斯五五五）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旳旳黄金色，□□白玉辉。\n既能明自□，□用暗中飞。\n（蒋云两句当作：「既能明自照，何用暗中飞？\n」与杜甫《倦夜》句式同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏晋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}